{"id":"3221cd5204a89eed","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"一阶原子公式","display":"df-atomic-formula — 一阶原子公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["18-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — 一阶原子公式","depends_on":["[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[18-df-term]]"],"source_correspondence":"本地依赖补全","local_revision":"2026-10-14","verification_status":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — 一阶原子公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" href=\"?note=a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" title=\"18-df-term\">18-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"本地依赖补全"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,R_n\">\\(S,R_n\\)</span> 与互斥构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" href=\"?note=a51b88c3e3a72ba5\" title=\"18-df-term\">18-df-term</a>。等号为逻辑等号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。后续 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\vec t)\">\\(R(\\vec t)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\doteq u\">\\(t\\doteq u\\)</span> 是关系原子与等号原子的树记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(R,\\vec t):n\\ge1,\\ R\\in R_n,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(R,\\vec t):n\\ge1,\\ R\\in R_n,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原缺失 atomic-formula 文件。两类原子均明确给出，关系的元数由其符号分量确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"a51b88c3e3a72ba5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"ca728af2af9b9d11","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,R_n$ 与互斥构造子见 [[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 见 [[18-df-term]]。等号为逻辑等号，$n\\ge1$。后续 $R(\\vec t)$ 和 $t\\doteq u$ 是关系原子与等号原子的树记号。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"a51b88c3e3a72ba5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,R_n$ 与互斥构造子见 [[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 见 [[18-df-term]]。等号为逻辑等号，$n\\ge1$。后续 $R(\\vec t)$ 和 $t\\doteq u$ 是关系原子与等号原子的树记号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,R_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"R(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"t\\doteq u","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf{eq}(t,u):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\mathsf{rel}(R,\\vec t):n\\ge1,\\ R\\in R_n,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}(S)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1054,"backlinks":[{"id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 及互斥构造树见 [[18-df-variable]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 分别为 [[18-df-term]]、[[18-df-atomic-formula]] 的项与原子公式集合，变量集取 $\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\mathrm{Var}$。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-atomic-formula]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-atomic-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["ca728af2af9b9d11","a51b88c3e3a72ba5"]}